Expose dictation prompts, vocabulary, language and UX toggles in Settings

Several Core/pipeline capabilities existed but had no UI. The Settings page now
edits them (all consumed by the tested ContextPromptBuilder / pipeline):

- Dictation section: honor "press enter" toggle, output language override,
  custom vocabulary, and optional dictation + command/edit prompt overrides.
- General section: play-sounds and show-overlay toggles (previously inert
  settings) alongside launch-at-login.

Load/save round-trips through AppSettings; prompt/vocabulary/language feed the
post-processing system prompt. App builds x86 clean.

